                "com_touch_cheek_Sleep_3": "$self$'s breathing remains steady and deep, completely unaware that her sleeping face is being played with.",
                "com_touch_cheek_Sleep_4": "$self$'s mouth parts slightly, letting out a cute snoring sound as her cheek is pinched, totally defenseless.",
                "com_touch_cheek_TimeStop_1": "$self$ remains frozen in her previous action, the skin pressed by the fingers showing an eerie stillness.",
                "com_touch_cheek_TimeStop_2": "$self$ unwittingly lets her cheek be pulled and distorted; the skin doesn't immediately bounce back after release.",
                "com_touch_cheek_TimeStop_3": "$self$ is like an exquisite doll, showing no physiological response to the violation from the outside world.",
